<title>SINGAPORE: Bangchak buys May MTBE from SABIC at $270/T.</title>
<headline>Bangchak buys May MTBE from SABIC at $270/T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangchak Petroleum Plc has bought by tender 1,500-tonne of methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) for delivery in May at $270 per tonne cost-and-freight Thailand, from Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC), industry sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender for the gasoline octane-booster, closed on April 10.</p>
<p>The award was slightly lower than Bangchak's last purchase, for April 16-30 delivery, which was also from SABIC at around $270-$275 per tonne, cost-and-freight Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3086)</p>
</text>
